The '''Mina-Rau General Store''' was a small store owned by the [[human]] [[Kellen]] on the agricultural [[planet]] [[Mina-Rau]]. The store was frequently visited by [[farmer]]s, and locals also used it as a hub for gossip.

==Description==
The store was a round<ref name="Sagrona Teema" /> [[metal]]<ref name="Sagrona Teema AD">{{Andor|Sagrona Teema}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> building located in fields of [[grain]]<ref name="Sagrona Teema" /> on the [[planet]] [[Mina-Rau]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|mina-rau-general-store|Mina-Rau General Store}}</ref>

==History==
By [[4 BBY]]<ref name="Andor Date">{{AndorDate|202}}</ref> the store was owned by a [[human]] named [[Kellen]] who ran it with the help of is [[marriage|wife]] [[Aneth]] and [[gender|daughter]] [[Beela]].<ref name="Kellen Databank">{{Databank|kellen|Kellen}}</ref> The store supplied local [[farmer]]s and [[Technician|mechanics]] with all their non-grain needs including local gossip and news.<ref name="Databank" /> A [[Krole's contingent|contingent]] of [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] visited the store after conducting an [[Imperial Supply Census]] at [[Council Five Hundred]] on Mina-Rau.<ref name="Sagrona Teema" />  

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:MinaRauShop-Exterior-RandolphWatson.jpg|200px|thumb|left|Concept art of general store by Randolph Watson]]
Mina-Rau General Store appeared in the [[Sagrona Teema|second episode]] of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the [[Disney+]] live-action series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' which was released<ref name="Sagrona Teema" /> on [[April 22]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref> It was identified as the "Mina-Rau General Store" in a [[Databank (2014-)|Databank]] entry posted to [[StarWars.com]].<ref name="Databank" />

